  "2026-08-14T00:25:36.993Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check and live evidence: all-status search reused this canonical item; no new item was created. Auto Release run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/31756603098 failed before tag creation with 1 timed-out test / 7,280 passed and then correctly failed the exact coverage gate because no coverage summary existed. Active scope is the Vitest execution/reporting policy and its regression tests only."
  "2026-08-14T00:35:48.918Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: the real Vitest child-process control now records a transient first-attempt failure as flaky and exits 0 only after retry; its paired persistent assertion retries once, exits 1, remains flaky=false, and is named in the JSON/job summary. Reporter-only coverage is exact 44/44 statements, 50/50 branches, 11/11 functions, 44/44 lines. Focused workflow/release/original-regression suite passes 49 tests; typecheck and ESLint pass."
  "2026-08-14T00:51:47.883Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: CI retains the 30-second per-test timeout with exactly one retry, and the custom reporter emits shard-scoped JSON plus GitHub job-summary identity, duration, timeout, retry, flaky, at-risk, and error fields. The executable transient control passes only on retry and records flaky=true/retry_count=1; the persistent assertion negative control retries once, exits 1, records flaky=false, and remains visible in JSON, summary, and logs. PM-linked acceptance passed 49/49; full repository coverage passed 493 files and 7,284 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; typecheck, ESLint, static/docstring/package/SDK/token/assurance gates, jscpd (0 clones), dependency audit (0 known vulnerabilities), and tracked-secret scan all passed. Manual exact coverage-shard invocation produced the expected reliability-1-4.json artifact and completed test-all-author in 872ms."
  "2026-08-14T01:02:26.072Z","harness:codex","Hosted exact-head evidence: all four coverage shards passed with retry/reporter enabled, but aggregate run 31758969510 failed before coverage calculation because reliability JSON shared the coverage-blob artifact namespace and Vitest merge-reports scanned it as a blob array. Fix scope: upload reliability reports under a separate artifact name so only blob-*.json enters .vitest-reports; add a workflow contract negative assertion."
  "2026-08-14T01:03:18.778Z","harness:codex","Hosted-failure correction: coverage-blob artifacts now contain only Vitest blob arrays; reliability JSON uploads separately as test-reliability-<shard>. The workflow contract asserts both artifact paths and explicitly proves the aggregate coverage job cannot receive reliability filenames. Focused workflow plus real retry controls pass 13/13, formatting/ESLint/diff checks pass, and the original four hosted shard jobs were green."
